  "text": "proprium.dominica-xi-post-pentecosten-graduale",
  "about": "The graduale of the formulary “11th Sunday after Pentecost” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": {
      "translation": "In God my heart trusts, and I find help; then my heart exults, and with my song I give Him thanks. To You, O Lord, I call; O my God, be not deaf to me; depart not from me."
    }
  },
